31
00:02:07,466 --> 00:02:11,810
The options market also forecasts the sea: the VIX. It moves with

32
00:02:11,910 --> 00:02:16,733
the volatility that follows, but sits above it on eighty-four percent of

33
00:02:16,833 --> 00:02:20,767
