34
00:02:21,866 --> 00:02:26,170
So: value at risk is a wall, and backtesting counts the days the

35
00:02:26,270 --> 00:02:30,849
sea came over it. Measure the sea well, from intraday data or fading

36
00:02:30,949 --> 00:02:35,872
